N5bAQ7kNvwGep9EH&_nc_oc=AdrCDfOggkwCRRxJer5jDVUkjTX1Wl7pcGVGBtgKDO6Vs6gBF1nL7sbYGvTVnMmdf6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWpxsNHGwXYCeuyB63y6EwMK8WmG_bY9IDgpIWbDDX1vg&oe=6B1064DF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FailFactory_VideoCover.png", "id": "1947286778821967", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162717_1947286782155300_8392115553761755136_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mmHBsMYYGQgQ7kNvwFwxXot&_nc_oc=Ado9R5wCitTpMvQPYNP3sunBVNs076r2iB4-sq3_POqietpVRRGLvNxMZMobNN9JpWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUdHsgiZzYCBLjC-NCOizI3Kbq6QC5AaG8yeg7AhtWGog&oe=6B1049EE"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep 